u.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010566"},"fr":{"name":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Comme de nombreuses communes bruxelloises, Woluwe-Saint-Pierre a connu la construction de plusieurs petites cit\u00e9s-jardins, et ce d\u00e8s les ann\u00e9es 1920 : cit\u00e9 Joli-Bois, cit\u00e9 des Venelles, cit\u00e9 de l\u2019Amiti\u00e9\u2026 autant de noms \u00e9vocateurs qui traduisent bien les aspirations id\u00e9alistes que ces lieux ont accueillies. Si, \u00e0 l\u2019heure actuelle, la majorit\u00e9 de ces cit\u00e9s n\u2019accueillent plus forc\u00e9ment du logement social, elles n\u2019en restent pas moins les t\u00e9moins d\u2019exp\u00e9rimentations architecturales et urbanistiques destin\u00e9es \u00e0 mettre le logement d\u00e9cent \u00e0 port\u00e9e de tous.\n\nLa visite sera \u00e9galement l\u2019occasion de faire le point sur l\u2019avenir du champ des Dames Blanches : derni\u00e8re grande r\u00e9serve fonci\u00e8re devant \u00eatre d\u00e9di\u00e9e au logement public, elle est depuis des d\u00e9cennies confront\u00e9e \u00e0 des visions contradictoires et \u00e0 des conflits politiques tenaces. Face \u00e0 ceux-ci, il convient aujourd\u2019hui de prendre du recul pour \u00e9clairer, au regard des enjeux sociaux et environnementaux actuels, les projets actuellement sur la table.\n\nDur\u00e9e : 2h\n\nLieu de d\u00e9part : Devant l\u2019entr\u00e9e principale du Mus\u00e9e du Tram, avenue de Tervueren 364, 1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","performers":"Comme de nombreuses communes bruxelloises, Woluwe-Saint-Pierre a connu la construction de plusieurs petites cit\u00e9s-jardins, et ce d\u00e8s les ann\u00e9es 1920 : cit\u00e9 Joli-Bois, cit\u00e9 des Venelles, cit\u00e9 de l\u2019Amiti\u00e9...","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010566"},"sp":{"name":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010566"},"nl":{"name":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/arau.org","email":"info@arau.org","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010566"}},"place":{"last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:17:09+02:00","id":241773,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Stra\u00dfenbahnmuseum (Museum f\u00fcr \u00f6ffentlichen Nahverkehr Br\u00fcssel)","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"Das als Stra\u00dfenbahnmuseum (Mus\u00e9e du Tram) bekannte Museum, das in einem ehemaligen Stra\u00dfenbahndepot am Ende der Avenue de Tervuren untergebracht ist, birgt eine beachtliche Sammlung, die die Geschichte der \u00f6ffentlichen Verkehrsmittel in Br\u00fcssel - von 1860 bis heute -  Revue passieren l\u00e4sst. Mehr als sechzig Fahrzeuge und Vehikel sind ausgestellt: von Pferden gezogene oder dampfbetriebene Stra\u00dfenbahnen, Trolleybusse, Taxis, Busse etc.\r\nAn einigen Wochenende k\u00f6nnen sich die Besucher an Bord einer dieser historischen Stra\u00dfenbahnen begeben und auf einer Fahrt durch die Avenue Tervuren und den Wald For\u00eat de Soignes in das besondere Ambiente der 1920er-Jahre eintauchen! Mit einer historischen Buslinie entdecken Sie die verschiedenen Stadtviertel zwischen dem Museum und dem Place Royale: den Cinquantenaire-Park, das EU-Viertel etc. \r\nEinzelne Fahrzeuge sowie die S\u00e4le des Museums k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr Veranstaltungen aller Art angemietet werden.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e du Tram (Mus\u00e9e du Transport Urbain Bruxellois)","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Tram Museum","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"Trams, trolleybuses, buses, and taxis that have crisscrossed the capital for 150 years can be seen in these warehouses built in 1897. During the opening season you can make a trip with one of the historical vehicles and relive the atmosphere of the early 20th century on the Avenue de Tervuren and in the Sonian Forest.\r\nA dedicated Museum line with old buses takes you to the areas between the Museum and the Place Royale: Cinquantenaire Park, the European quarter, the squares quarter\u2026\r\nAdditionally, you can rent the vehicles as well as the museum halls for any kind of event.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=MUSSEETRANSPORTURBAIN&module=CATALOGUE&lg=EN","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e du Tram (Mus\u00e9e du Transport Urbain Bruxellois)","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e du Tram (Mus\u00e9e du Transport Urbain Bruxellois)","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e du Tram (Mus\u00e9e du Transport Urbain Bruxellois)","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"Mieux connu sous le nom de Mus\u00e9e du Tram (il est install\u00e9 dans un ancien d\u00e9p\u00f4t de trams, au bout de l'avenue de Tervuren), ce mus\u00e9e rassemble une tr\u00e8s belle collection qui retrace l'histoire du transport en commun \u00e0 Bruxelles depuis 1860 \u00e0 nos jours, avec plus de soixante v\u00e9hicules: tramways hippomobiles, tramways \u00e0 vapeur, trolleybus, taxis, bus urbains, etc.\r\nLors des week-ends d\u2019ouverture, il est possible d\u2019embarquer \u00e0 bord d'un des tramways historiques. Vous revivrez l\u2019ambiance du d\u00e9but du vingti\u00e8me si\u00e8cle en parcourant l\u2019avenue de Tervueren et en circulant \u00e0 travers la for\u00eat de Soignes! Et une ligne d\u2019autobus anciens vous permettra de d\u00e9couvrir diff\u00e9rents quartiers entre le Mus\u00e9e et la place Royale : Cinquantenaire, quartier europ\u00e9en, quartier des squares\u2026\r\nIl est possible de louer les v\u00e9hicules et les halls du Mus\u00e9e pour toutes sortes d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements.","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=MUSSEETRANSPORTURBAIN&module=CATALOGUE&lg=FR","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e du Tram (Mus\u00e9e du Transport Urbain Bruxellois)","address_street_name":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Avenue de Tervueren","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Trammuseum (Museum voor het Stedelijk Vervoer te Brussel)","address_street_name":"Tervurenlaan","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@trammuseum.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.trammuseum.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 515 31 08","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Sint-Pieters-Woluwe","address_line1":"Tervurenlaan","address_line2":"1150 Sint-Pieters-Woluwe","description_web":"Dit museum is bij het publiek beter bekend als het Trammuseum, al bestaat de collectie uit meer dan deze benaming laat vermoeden. In deze voormalige stelplaats is een uitgebreide collectie voertuigen te zien die in de straten van de hoofdstad hebben gereden, en dat over een periode van meer dan een eeuw. Ook documenten, foto's, oude informatieborden en andere parafernalia in verband met het Brusselse openbaar vervoer zijn er te zien.\r\nTijdens de weekends van het openingsseizoen kan je meerijden met \u00e9\u00e9n van de historische voertuigen en zo de sfeer herbeleven van het begin van de twintigste eeuw op de Tervurenlaan en in het Zoni\u00ebnwoud. Er is ook een buslijn met oude bussen die de verschillende wijken aandoen tussen het Museum en het Koningsplein: het Jubelpark, de Europese wijk, de wijk van de squares\u2026\r\nDe museumhallen en de voertuigen kunnen voor verschillende soorten evenementen afgehuurd worden .","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/shop.utick.be\/?pos=MUSSEETRANSPORTURBAIN&module=CATALOGUE&lg=NL","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":4235,"location":{"lat":50.83160112,"lon":4.43434455},"region":"brussels","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"last_updated_at":"2024-04-18T16:00:05+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:31+02:00","id":204134,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Understanding Brussels to better defend it!\r\nARAU was founded in 1969, in a context of \u2018Brusselsisation\u2019 and the exodus of Brussels residents to the periphery. The challenge at the time, which is still relevant today, was to defend and promote the inhabited city and a quality of life for all the inhabitants of Brussels. This led to major protests against demolition projects on the one hand and the development of counter-projects on the other, with a view to urban renewal and improving the living environment.\r\nThe ARAU intends, through its action to raise awareness and inform the population, to provide the public with the necessary tools to monitor the evolution of the city. This action takes the form of the publication of analyses and studies, the organisation of conferences and workshops, press releases, etc., as well as guided tours.\r\nThese tours, which are pioneering in the Brussels region and have been organised since 1977, aim to enhance the city and its assets, and to develop a critical view of its transformations, which includes the preservation and maintenance of its heritage.\r\nOver the years, the ARAU has developed a rich catalogue of guided tours on various themes: \u201cUnmissable Brussels\u201d, \u201cArchitecture\u201d, \u201cBrussels in Districts\u201d, \u201cThe City in Transformation\u201d, \u201cSummer Journey\u201d, \u201cA Brussels House\u201d, \u201cBrussels: City of Trams\u201d, \u201cSocial Brussels\u201d, which can be discovered during public tours or in the form of private, customised tours.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"ARAU - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Comprendre Bruxelles pour mieux la d\u00e9fendre !\r\nL\u2019ARAU a \u00e9t\u00e9 fond\u00e9 en 1969, dans un contexte de \u00ab bruxellisation \u00bb et d\u2019exode des Bruxellois vers la p\u00e9riph\u00e9rie. L\u2019enjeu \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, toujours d\u2019actualit\u00e9 : d\u00e9fendre et promouvoir la ville habit\u00e9e et une qualit\u00e9 de vie pour tous les Bruxellois, ce qui s\u2019est traduit par d\u2019importantes contestations de projets de d\u00e9molition d\u2019une part et le d\u00e9veloppement de contre-projets d\u2019autre part, dans une optique de r\u00e9novation urbaine et d\u2019am\u00e9lioration du cadre de vie.\r\nL\u2019ARAU entend, par son action de sensibilisation et d\u2019information de la population, mettre \u00e0 disposition du public les outils n\u00e9cessaires pour suivre l\u2019\u00e9volution de la ville. Cette action se mat\u00e9rialise \u00e0 travers la publication d\u2019analyses et d\u2019\u00e9tudes, l\u2019organisation de colloques et d\u2019ateliers, des communiqu\u00e9s de presse, \u2026ainsi que de visites guid\u00e9es.\r\nCes visites, pionni\u00e8res en r\u00e9gion bruxelloise et organis\u00e9es depuis 1977, visent \u00e0 revaloriser la ville et ses atouts, \u00e0 d\u00e9velopper un regard critique sur ses transformations, ce qui passe par la sauvegarde et l\u2019entretien de son patrimoine.\r\nAu fil de toutes ces ann\u00e9es, l\u2019ARAU a d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 un riche catalogue de visites guid\u00e9es se d\u00e9clinant en diverses th\u00e9matiques : \u00ab Bruxelles incontournable \u00bb, \u00ab Architecture \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles en quartiers \u00bb, \u00ab La ville en transformation \u00bb, \u00ab Parcours d\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 \u00bb, \u00ab Une maison bruxelloise \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles : ville de trams \u00bb, \u00ab Bruxelles sociale \u00bb, qu\u2019il est possible de d\u00e9couvrir lors de tours publics ou sous forme de visites priv\u00e9es, personnalisables.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi, 165","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Arau - Atelier de Recherche et d'Action Urbaines","address_street_name":"Zuidstraat","address_street_number":"165","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arau.org","website":"http:\/\/www.arau.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 33 45","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zuidstraat, 165","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Brussel begrijpen om het beter te kunnen verdedigen!\r\nHet ARAU werd opgericht in 1969, in een context van \u201cBrusselisering\u201d en de uittocht van de Brusselaars naar de rand. De uitdaging van die tijd, die ook vandaag nog actueel is, bestond erin de bewoonde stad en de levenskwaliteit van alle Brusselaars te verdedigen en te bevorderen. Dat leidde tot grote protesten tegen afbraakprojecten enerzijds en de ontwikkeling van tegenprojecten anderzijds, met het oog op stadsvernieuwing en verbetering van de leefomgeving.\r\nHet ARAU wil met zijn bewustmakings- en voorlichtingsactie de bevolking de nodige instrumenten aanreiken om de evolutie van de stad te volgen. Deze actie neemt de vorm aan van de publicatie van analyses en studies, de organisatie van conferenties en workshops, perscommuniqu\u00e9s, enz. en rondleidingen.\r\nDeze rondleidingen, die baanbrekend zijn in het Brusselse Gewest en al sinds 1977 worden georganiseerd, hebben tot doel de stad en haar troeven tot hun recht te laten komen en een kritische kijk te ontwikkelen op haar transformaties, die ook het behoud en de instandhouding van haar erfgoed inhouden.\r\nIn de loop der jaren heeft het ARAU een rijke catalogus van rondleidingen over verschillende thema\u2019s samengesteld: \u201cOnmisbaar Brussel\u201d, \u201cArchitectuur\u201d, \u201cBrussel in wijken\u201d, \u201cDe stad in transformatie\u201d, \u201cZomerreis\u201d, \u201cEen Brussels huis\u201d, \u201cBrussel: stad van de trams\u201d, \u201cSociaal Brussel\u201d, die tijdens openbare rondleidingen of in de vorm van priv\u00e9rondleidingen op maat kunnen worden ontdekt.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":422,"location":{"lat":50.84343195,"lon":4.34634563},"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/aa8adc70fa60634649480210fdb28c9c39f1d52a.jpg","width":1107,"height":1500,"ratio":0.74,"oEmbed_height":1500,"oEmbed_width":1107,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","copyright":"Patrimoine Bruxelles"},"pt":{"title":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","copyright":"Patrimoine Bruxelles"},"en":{"title":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","copyright":"Patrimoine Bruxelles"},"it":{"title":"Venelles, Jooli Bois, Dames Blanches : des cit\u00e9s-jardins \u00e0 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","copyright":