"phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"pt":{"name":"Sur les traces de Lamoral, comte d'Egmont, & Philippe de Montmorency, comte de Hornes","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"en":{"name":"Sur les traces de Lamoral, comte d'Egmont, & Philippe de Montmorency, comte de Hornes","shortdescr":"Follow the guide on the tracks of Egmont and Horne, two key figures of Brussels' past, symbols of pacification and religious tolerance","longdescr":"Lamorel d'Egmont, Philippe de Hornes, two names that mean rebellion against the austere Spanish yoke in this second half of the 16th century. For the 450th anniversary of the beheading of these two heroes, heralds of pacification and religious tolerance in our regions, we propose to follow a route where we will meet their companions, symbols of the domination of the Duke of Alba, places of this tragedy narrated by Goethe in the 19th century.\r\n\r\nPrivate visit, organized on demand","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"it":{"name":"Sur les traces de Lamoral, comte d'Egmont, & Philippe de Montmorency, comte de Hornes","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"cn":{"name":"Sur les traces de Lamoral, comte d'Egmont, & Philippe de Montmorency, comte de Hornes","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"fr":{"name":"Sur les traces de Lamoral, comte d'Egmont, & Philippe de Montmorency, comte de Hornes","shortdescr":"Suivez le guide sur les traces d'Egmont et Horne, deux personnages cl\u00e9 du pass\u00e9 Bruxellois, symboles de pacification et tol\u00e9rance religieuse","longdescr":"Lamoral d'Egmont, Philippe de Hornes, deux noms qui fleurent comme une odeur de fronde face \u00e0 un aust\u00e8re joug espagnol en cette seconde moiti\u00e9 du XVI\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Arp\u00e8s 450 ans de la d\u00e9capitation de ces deux h\u00e9ros, h\u00e9rauts de la pacification, de la tol\u00e9rance religieuse dans nos r\u00e9gions, nous vous proposons de suivre un parcours o\u00f9 nous rencontrerons leurs compagnons, des symboles de la domination du duc d'Albe, des lieux de cette trag\u00e9die narr\u00e9e par Goethe au XIX\u00e8me.\r\n\r\nVisite privative, organis\u00e9e sur mesure et \u00e0 la demande","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"sp":{"name":"tras los pasos de Lamoral, conde de Egmont, y Felipe de Montmorency, conde de Horn","shortdescr":"tras los pasos de Lamoral, conde de Egmont, y Felipe de Montmorency, conde de Horn","longdescr":"Lamoral d'Egmont y Felipe de Horn, dos nombres que hacen referencia a la subyugaci\u00f3n espa\u00f1ola en la segunda mitad del siglo XVI. Con motivo del aniversario de la decapitaci\u00f3n de estas dos figuras, h\u00e9roes de la pacificaci\u00f3n y de la tolerancia religiosa en nuestras regiones, te proponemos seguir una ruta en la que conoceremos a sus compa\u00f1eros, los s\u00edmbolos de la dominaci\u00f3n del duque de Alba y los lugares de esta tragedia narrada por Goethe en el siglo XIX.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"},"nl":{"name":"Sur les traces de Lamoral, comte d'Egmont, & Philippe de Montmorency, comte de Hornes","shortdescr":"Volg de gids in de voetsporen van Egmont en Horne, twee sleutelfiguren uit het verleden van Brussel, symbolen van pacificatie en religieuze tolerantie.","longdescr":"Lamorel d'Egmont, Philippe de Hornes, twee namen die staan voor opstand tegen het strenge Spaanse juk in deze tweede helft van de 16e eeuw. Ter gelegenheid van de 450e verjaardag van de onthoofding van deze twee helden, herauten van de pacificatie en de religieuze tolerantie in onze streken, stellen wij voor een route te volgen waarbij we hun metgezellen ontmoeten, symbolen van de overheersing van de hertog van Alba, plaatsen van deze tragedie die in de 19e eeuw door Goethe werd verteld.\r\n\r\nPriv\u00e9bezoek, georganiseerd op aanvraag en op maat","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.554658"}},"place":{"id":207330,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Kirche Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Kirche ist ein pr\u00e4chtiges Beispiel f\u00fcr die Entwicklung der Brabanter Spitzbogenarchitektur. Ihre Sch\u00f6nheit verdankt sie den Armbrustsch\u00fctzen der Stadt, die sie im 15. Jahrhundert erbauten. Vertreter der Familie Thurn und Taxis fanden ihre letzte Ruhe in den Sarkophagen unter der Sankt-Ursula-Kapelle. Sowohl die Architektur als auch die bunten Kirchenfenster sind absolut sehenswert. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Igreja de Nossa Senhora das Vit\u00f3rias de Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esta igreja \u00e9 um exemplo perfeito do florescimento da arte ogival de Brabante. Deve a sua beleza aos carpinteiros da cidade, que a constru\u00edram no s\u00e9culo XV. V\u00e1rios membros da fam\u00edlia de Tour e Tassis est\u00e3o a\u00ed reunidos nos sarc\u00f3fagos por baixo da capela Sainte-Ursule, que se tornou o seu lugar de sepultura. Se passar pr\u00f3ximo desta igreja, n\u00e3o hesite em entrar, para contemplar a sua arquitetura e os seus v\u00e1rios vitrais.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons ","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons ","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This church is a precious example of the development of ogival art from Brabant.\r\nIt owes its beauty to the city\u2019s crossbowmen, who built it in the 15th century.\r\nSeveral member of the Thurn und Taxis family are buried there in sarcophagi placed under the chapel of Saint Ursula, which is their burial site. If you pass by this church, do not hesitate to enter and contemplate its architecture and numerous stained glass windows.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Cette \u00e9glise est un exemple pr\u00e9cieux de l\u2019\u00e9panouissement de l\u2019art ogival du Brabant.\r\nIl doit sa beaut\u00e9 aux arbal\u00e9triers de la ville qui la b\u00e2tirent au 15e si\u00e8cle.  \r\nPlusieurs membres de la famille de Tour et Tassis y sont rassembl\u00e9s dans des sarcophages plac\u00e9s sous la chapelle Sainte-Ursule, qui est d\u00e9sormais leur lieu de s\u00e9pulture. Si vous passez pr\u00e8s de cette \u00e9glise, n\u2019h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 y entrer afin d\u2019y contempler son architecture et ses nombreux vitraux. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"\u00c9glise Notre-Dame des Victoires du Sablon","address_street_name":"Rue des Sablons","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sablons","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Esta iglesia es un ejemplo precioso del desarrollo del arte ojival de Brabante.\r\nDebe su belleza a los ballesteros de la ciudad que la reedificaron en el siglo XV.\r\nVarios miembros de la familia de Thurn y Taxis se encuentran en los sarc\u00f3fagos de la capilla de Santa \u00darsula, que es actualmente su lugar de sepultura.\r\nSi visitas esta iglesia, no dudes en entrar y contemplar su arquitectura y sus numerosas vitrinas.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"O.L.V. Ten Zavel","address_street_name":"Zavelstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zavelstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Deze kerk is een waardevol voorbeeld van de bloei van de Brabantse laatgotische kunst. Ze dankt haar schoonheid aan de Grote Gilde van Kruisboogschutters van de stad, die haar in de 15e eeuw bouwden. Verscheidene leden van de familie Thurn und Taxis kwamen samen in de sarcofagen onder de barokke Heilige Ursulakapel, daar waar nu hun begraafplaats is. Als u in de omgeving van deze kerk komt, aarzel dan niet om er binnen te gaan om de architectuur en de vele glas-in-loodramen te bezichtingen. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":458,"location":{"lat":50.83998854,"lon":4.35581725},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:33+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":230072,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CULTURAL EVENTS SINCE 1986 \r\nAre you looking for fresh and creative incentive, team-building, or social programs for your clients? Contact us and fi nd out what\u2019s on the \u201cmenu\u201d: \r\n\u2022  Unforgettable rallies: CULTURAL CITY GAME\r\nNEW! \u201cBloody inquiry, become one of our most famous detective\u201d On foot, tuk tuk,... \r\n\u2022  Dine Around (3 courses in 3 differents venues)\r\n\u2022  Private Castles for exclusive events & atmosphere and exclusive tours\r\n\u2022  Thematic Diner: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilities of : costumed guides, live band, a Jacques Brel singer,... \r\n\u2022  Custom-tailored itineraires: Art Nouveau, Trendy Antwerp, Brel and Brussels by night, Beer and chocolate, another Bruges, Simenon and Maigret, Fashion workshops, design, Brussels is there for you, the Gay Brussels, \u201cWho killed Sir the Count?\u201d, Sustainable Brussels.\r\n\r\nIn Brussels and all Belgium. Our programs are exclusive and interactive.\r\nOur team: \r\n\u2022  2 specialists who ensure that your program meets your objectives and exceeds your clients expectations. \r\n\u2022  100 multilingual guides, entertainers, coordinators, hotesses, ... specialists in Belgium\u2019s off  the beaten path treasures. \r\n\u2022  We answer 7 days a week \r\n\u2022 Our aim: to live art as an \u201cArt de Vivre\u201d ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Professionnels dans l'organisation d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels depuis 1986.\r\nVous \u00eates \u00e0 la recherche d'un team-building cr\u00e9atif et culturel pour vos collaborateurs? Ou d'un programme social pour vos clients? Contactez-nous et d\u00e9couvrez nos propositions:\r\n- Rallyes inoubliables: New: \"Enigme sanglant, mais qui a tu\u00e9 monsieur le Comte?\" devenez un detective et trouvez la solution: \u00e0 pied, en tuk tuk, dans une old timer...\r\n- Chateaux et lieux exclusifs pour vos \u00e9v\u00e9nements d\u2019atmosph\u00e8re et tour VIP\r\n- Diner Thematique: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilit\u00e9 de l'agr\u00e9menter avec: guides costum\u00e9s, musique live, interpr\u00e8te de Jacques Brel, magiciens, danseurs, acteurs,...\r\n- Itin\u00e9raires sur mesure: Art Nouveau, Anvers \u00e0 la mode, hommage \u00e0 Brel, Brussels by night, Bi\u00e8re et Chocolat, Bruxelles insolite, Simenon et Maigret, Atelier mode, design, Le Gay Bruxelles, \"Qui a tu\u00e9...\", Bruxelles durable.\r\n\r\nSur Bruxelles et toute la Belgique. Nous r\u00e9pondons sur mesure et \u00e0 la demande.\r\nNotre Equipe:\r\n- 4 professionnels pour s'assurer que votre programme atteigne vos objectifs et d\u00e9passe les attentes de vos clients.\r\n- 200 guides multilingues, acteurs, coordinateurs, hotesses,... sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans la mise \u00e0 l'honneur de la Belgique et ses tr\u00e9sors cach\u00e9s.\r\n- 7 jours sur 7\r\n- Notre objectif: vivre l'Art comme un Art de Vivre.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Waterleidingsstraat","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Waterleidingsstraat, 171","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":824,"location":{"lat":50.82309922,"lon":4.36268486},"last_updated_at":"2024-06-21T11:48:23+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:49+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/9ce4047def3dc609bfc5b6050052c476a9f04466.png","width":1600,"height":2400,"ratio":0.67,"oEmbed_height":2400,"oEmbed_wi