el19.be","website":"http:\/\/www.archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1082","address_city":"Berchem-Sainte-Agathe","address_line1":"Place de l'Eglise, 15","address_line2":"1082 Berchem-Sainte-Agathe","description_web":"La programmation de l'Archipel 19 navigue entre des formes vari\u00e9es : projections, spectacles, ateliers cr\u00e9atifs et d\u2019\u00e9panouissement personnel, festival des arts de la rue (Visueel Festival Visuel), concerts, conf\u00e9rences, \u00e9changes de savoirs, r\u00e9sidences d\u2019artistes\u2026 Elle invite \u00e0 voyager \u00e0 la rencontre de mondes multiples via la diversit\u00e9 des formes d\u2019expression, croisant la cr\u00e9ation artistique et l\u2019exercice de la citoyennet\u00e9. \r\n\r\nPourquoi Archipel 19 ? Un archipel est un ensemble d\u2019\u00eeles reli\u00e9es par les courants et les embarcations qui y circulent. 19 pour les 19 communes de Bruxelles, et aussi, et surtout, pour le num\u00e9ro du tram qui relie Berchem-Sainte-Agathe \u00e0 Koekelberg, territoires d\u2019exploration du Centre Culturel, o\u00f9 se d\u00e9ploie au gr\u00e9 des vents son action culturelle. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Archipel 19 Centre culturel Berchem-Sainte-Agathe et Koekelberg. ","address_street_name":"Place de l'Eglise","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@archipel19.be","website":"http:\/\/www.archipel19.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 469 26 75","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1082","address_city":"Berchem-Sainte-Agathe","address_line1":"Place de l'Eglise, 15","address_line2":"1082 Berchem-Sainte-Agathe","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Archipel 19 Centre culturel Berchem-Sainte-Agathe et Koekelberg. ","address_street_name":"Kerkplein","address_street_number":"15","