3-6 Jahre","Jugendliche 12-15 Jahre","Jugendliche 15-18 Jahre","Kinder 9-12 Jahre","Lehrkr\u00e4fte","Familie","Schulen","Geh\u00f6rlose\/H\u00f6rbehinderte","Kinder 0-3 Jahre","Senioren"],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"en":["LGTBQIA","Children 6-9 yr.","Children 3-6 yr.","Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr.","Children 9-12 yr.","Teachers","Family","Schools","Deaf\/hard of hearing","Children 0-3 yr.","Seniors"],"it":["LGTBQIA","Bambini 6-9 anni","Bambini 3-6 anni","Ragazzi 12-15 anni","Ragazzi 15-18 anni","Bambini 9-12 anni","Insegnanti","Famiglie","Scuole","Non udenti\/ipoudenti","Bambini 0-3 anni","Anziani"],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"fr":["LGTBQIA","Enfants 6-9 ans","Enfants 3-6 ans","Jeunes 12-15 ans","Jeunes 15-18 ans","Enfants 9-12 ans","Enseignants","Famille","Ecoles","Sourd\/malentendant","Enfants 0-3 ans","Seniors"],"sp":["LGTBQIA","Ni\u00f1os de 6 a 9 a\u00f1os","Ni\u00f1os de 3 a 6 a\u00f1os","J\u00f3venes de 12 a 15 a\u00f1os","J\u00f3venes de 15 a 18 a\u00f1os","Ni\u00f1os de 9 a 12 a\u00f1os","Profesores","Familias","Escuelas","Personas sordas o con problemas de audici\u00f3n","Ni\u00f1os de 0 a 3 a\u00f1os","Personas de la tercera edad"],"nl":["LGTBQIA","Kinderen 6-9 j.","Kinderen 3-6 j.","Jongeren 12-15 j.","Jongeren 15-18 j.","Kinderen 9-12 j.","Leerkrachten","Familie","Scholen","Doof\/slechthorend","Kinderen 0-3 j.","Senioren"]}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["kids"],"opening":{"day":"2024-05-30","end":"21:00:00","start":"19:00:00","timestamp":"2024-05-30T19:00:00"}},{"id":50010909,"date_start":"2024-05-24","date_end":"2024-10-13","date_next":"2024-06-25","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-06-24T02:01:01+02:00","published_at":"2024-05-21T12:58:57+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":300580,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.2409339418591454,"languages":{"spoken":["en","nl","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibition","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Exposition","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"The Modernization of Brussels - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"pt":{"name":"The Modernization of Brussels - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"en":{"name":"The Modernization of Brussels - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":"Since the start of his career as an architect, Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978) had planned to radically modernize Brussels. \u201cThe city with a rotten core\u201d was to undergo a vast demolition and reconstruction program geared toward accommodating the new means of transport that would revolutionize town and country planning: the automobile.","longdescr":"Since the start of his career as an architect, Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978) had planned to radically modernize Brussels. \u201cThe city with a rotten core\u201d was to undergo a vast demolition and reconstruction program geared toward accommodating the new means of transport that would revolutionize town and country planning: the automobile. The modernization of the city center was reserved for national administration buildings and modern public facilities, while large housing buildings were to be constructed in park areas in the city\u2019s green outskirts.\n\nWith the exception of the Deurne airport near Antwerp and the Bordet Hospital in Brussels, none of Jasinski\u2019s major projects were completed and he never became the great architect of the \u201cBelgian Nation\u201d that he aspired to be. Not for want of trying: his plans included a project for three cruciform towers to house all of Belgium\u2019s administrative offices; a project for the Albertine Royal Library; a project for a residential tower on Louise Avenue; a project for the development of Antwerp\u2019s left bank; a project for a Mundaneum to be presented at Expo \u201958; a project for the Belgian radio and television network; and, finally, a project for the Palace of the Academies.\n\nOn the occasion of the exhibition opening on 23.05, CIVA and CFC-Editions will present the book Stanislas Jasinski. Un architecte moderniste (1901-1978), Yaron Pesztat (dir.), Amaury De Smet, Geoffrey Grulois, CFC-Editions, Brussels 2024.","performers":"Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"it":{"name":"The Modernization of Brussels - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"cn":{"name":"The Modernization of Brussels - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"fr":{"name":"La Modernisation\u2009 de Bruxelles - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":"D\u00e8s les d\u00e9buts de sa carri\u00e8re d\u2019architecte, Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978) projette de moderniser radicalement Bruxelles. \u00ab\u2009La ville au c\u0153ur pourri\u2009\u00bb doit faire l\u2019objet d\u2019un vaste programme de d\u00e9molition-reconstruction destin\u00e9 \u00e0 accueillir ce nouveau moyen de locomotion qui va r\u00e9volutionner l\u2019urbanisme et l\u2019am\u00e9nagement du territoire\u2009: l\u2019automobile. ","longdescr":"D\u00e8s les d\u00e9buts de sa carri\u00e8re d\u2019architecte, Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978) projette de moderniser radicalement Bruxelles. \u00ab\u2009La ville au c\u0153ur pourri\u2009\u00bb doit faire l\u2019objet d\u2019un vaste programme de d\u00e9molition-reconstruction destin\u00e9 \u00e0 accueillir ce nouveau moyen de locomotion qui va r\u00e9volutionner l\u2019urbanisme et l\u2019am\u00e9nagement du territoire\u2009: l\u2019automobile. La modernisation du centre est r\u00e9serv\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019administration nationale et aux grands \u00e9quipements collectifs modernes tandis que la p\u00e9riph\u00e9rie verte accueille de grands immeubles de logement situ\u00e9s dans des parcs.\n\nHormis l\u2019a\u00e9roport de Deurne pr\u00e8s d\u2019Anvers et l\u2019h\u00f4pital Bordet \u00e0 Bruxelles, aucun des grands projets de Jasinski n\u2019aboutira et il ne sera pas le grand architecte de la \u00ab\u2009Nation belge\u2009\u00bb qu\u2019il ambitionnait de devenir. Et pourtant, ce n\u2019est pas faute d\u2019avoir essay\u00e9\u2009: projet de trois tours cruciformes concentrant toute l\u2019administration belge, projet pour la biblioth\u00e8que de l\u2019Albertine, projet de tour r\u00e9sidentielle pour l\u2019avenue Louise, projet de r\u00e9am\u00e9nagement de la rive gauche d\u2019Anvers, projet de Mundaneum dans le cadre de l\u2019Expo 58, projet pour la Radio-t\u00e9l\u00e9vision belge, et enfin, projet pour le Palais des Acad\u00e9mies.\n\nA l\u2019occasion du vernissage de l\u2019exposition le 23.05, le CIVA et CFC-Editions pr\u00e9senteront le livre Stanislas Jasinski. Un architecte moderniste (1901-1978), Yaron Pesztat (dir.), Amaury De Smet, Geoffrey Grulois, CFC-Editions, Bruxelles 2024.","performers":"Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"sp":{"name":"The Modernization of Brussels - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"},"nl":{"name":"De Mordernisering van Brussel - Stanislas Jasinski","shortdescr":"Vanaf het begin van zijn carri\u00e8re als architect heeft Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978) plannen om Brussel radicaal te moderniseren. 'De stad met het verrotte hart' moet het voorwerp worden van een groot afbraak- en wederopbouwprogramma, bedoeld om plaats te bieden aan het nieuwe transportmiddel dat de ruimtelijke ordening radicaal zal veranderen: de auto. ","longdescr":"Vanaf het begin van zijn carri\u00e8re als architect heeft Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978) plannen om Brussel radicaal te moderniseren. 'De stad met het verrotte hart' moet het voorwerp worden van een groot afbraak- en wederopbouwprogramma, bedoeld om plaats te bieden aan het nieuwe transportmiddel dat de ruimtelijke ordening radicaal zal veranderen: de auto. De modernisering van het centrum is voorbehouden aan de nationale administratie en grote moderne openbare voorzieningen, terwijl in de groene periferie grote woonblokken in parken worden gepland.\n\nMet uitzondering van de luchthaven van Deurne bij Antwerpen en het Bordetziekenhuis in Brussel zou geen enkel groot project van Jasinski tot stand komen en hij zou nooit de grote architect van de \u2018Belgische natie\u2019 worden die hij wilde zijn. Aan een gebrek aan pogingen zal het niet hebben gelegen: er was een project voor drie kruisvormige torens waarin de hele Belgische administratie zou worden ondergebracht, een project voor de Albertinabibliotheek, een project voor een woontoren in de Louizalaan, een project voor de herontwikkeling van linkeroever in Antwerpen, een project voor een Mundaneum als onderdeel van Expo 58, een project voor de Belgische Radio en Televisie, en tot slot een project voor het Paleis der Academi\u00ebn.\n\nTer gelegenheid van de opening van de tentoonstelling op 23.05 presenteren CIVA en CFC-Editions het boek Stanislas Jasinski. Un architecte moderniste (1901-1978), Yaron Pesztat (dir.), Amaury De Smet, Geoffrey Grulois, CFC-Editions, Brussel 2024.","performers":"Stanislas Jasinski (1901-1978)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010909"}},"place":{"id":235577,"translations":{"de":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Architekturzentrum CIVA, das 2016 auf Betreiben der Region Br\u00fcssel-Hauptstadt ins Leben gerufen wurde, vereint in einer einzigen Struktur Ressourcen, Wissen und Know-how verschiedener Br\u00fcsseler Vereine aus dem Bereich Kultur, Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Landschaftsarchitektur und Forschungen zum \u00d6kosystem: die Archive f\u00fcr moderne Architektur, die Bibliothek Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, der Architekturfonds und das Centre Paul Duvigneaud.\r\nMit ihrem kulturellen Projekt tr\u00e4gt die Fondation CIA zur Entwicklung einer architektonischen, landschaftsarchitektonischen und st\u00e4dteplanerischen Kultur bei, die sich mit den Herausforderungen der Gegenwart auseinandersetzt. Schwerpunkt ist Br\u00fcssel. \r\n\r\nDie Fondation CIVA bietet eine ganze Reihe von Aktivit\u00e4ten und Angeboten: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Orte des Austauschs und der Debatten, p\u00e4dagogische Aktivit\u00e4ten, Archiveinblicke und Bibliotheken mit knapp 40.000 Werken und Zeitschriften zu den Themen Architektur, St\u00e4dteplanung, Stadtgeschichte, Landschaften, G\u00e4rten und urbane \u00d6kosysteme.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA is a museum, an archive center, a library and a meeting place for lovers of architecture, landscape architecture, urban ecosystems and history in Brussels. Throughout the year, CIVA organizes temporary exhibitions, lectures, debates, guided tours, book launches and activities for children. The activities are organized in Ixelles, near Place Flagey and in the center of Brussels, in KANAL - Centre Pompidou.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CIVA est un muse\u0301e, un centre d'archives, une bibliothe\u0300que et un lieu de rencontre pour les amateurs d'architecture, d'architecture paysage\u0300re, d'e\u0301cosyste\u0300mes urbains et d'histoire a\u0300 Bruxelles. Tout au long de l'anne\u0301e, vous pouvez vous y rendre pour des expositions temporaires, des confe\u0301rences, des de\u0301bats, des visites guide\u0301es, des lancements de livres et des activite\u0301s pour les enfants. Les activite\u0301s se trouvent a\u0300 Ixelles, pre\u0300s de la Place Flagey et au centre de Bruxelles, a\u0300 KANAL - Centre Pompidou.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Ermitage","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Creado en 2016 por iniciativa de la Regi\u00f3n Bruselas-Capital, el CIVA re\u00fane una \u00fanica estructura de recursos, conocimiento y aprendizaje de varias asociaciones culturales activas en Bruselas en los campos de la arquitectura, urbanismo, paisajes y el estudio de ecosistemas: los Archivos de Arquitectura Moderna, la Biblioteca Ren\u00e9 Pech\u00e8re, los Fondos para la arquitectura, el Centro Paul Duvigneaud y el CIVA asbl, ahora disuelto.\r\nA trav\u00e9s de este proyecto cultural, la Fundaci\u00f3n CIVA contribuye al desarrollo del paisaje arquitect\u00f3nico y la cultura urbana como base para afrontar desaf\u00edos contempor\u00e1neos, poniendo especial \u00e9nfasis en Bruselas.\r\nSiempre tiene \u00e9xito a la hora de cumplir sus objetivos y tratar con un p\u00fablico amplio (adultos y ni\u00f1os, estudiantes, investigadores, arquitectos, paisajistas, amantes de la naturaleza, pol\u00edticos, etc), la fundaci\u00f3n CIVA organiza numerosos eventos y actividades en diferentes lugares, incluyendo exhibiciones permanentes y temporales, conferencias, debates y actividades educativas. Tambi\u00e9n dispone archivos excepcionales abiertos para todos los p\u00fablicos (documentos de arquitectos y paisajistas: planos, bocetos, modelos, muebles, etc.) y librer\u00edas que contienen casi 40.000 obras y peri\u00f3dicos de arquitectura, urbanismo, la historia de los pueblos y ciudades, paisajes, jardines y ecolog\u00eda urbana.\r\nEstas actividades y materiales est\u00e1n dise\u00f1ados para despertar la curiosidad y el inter\u00e9s de todo nuestro entorno, ya sea un hecho hist\u00f3rico o una construcci\u00f3n.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"CIVA","address_street_name":"Kluisstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 642 24 50","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kluisstraat","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"CIVA is een museum, een archiefcentrum, een bibliotheek en een ontmoetingsplek voor liefhebbers van architectuur, landschapsarchitectuur, stadsecosystemen en geschiedenis in Brussel. Het hele jaar door kan je er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, lezingen, debatten, rondleidingen, book launches en kinderactiviteiten. De activiteiten vind je in Elsene, vlakbij het Flageyplein en in Brussel-centrum, in KANAL \u2013 Centre Pompidou.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"CIVA","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[5],"translations":{"de":["Flagey"],"pt":[null],"en":["Flagey"],"it":["Flagey"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Flagey"],"sp":["Flagey"],"nl":["Flagey"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":1436,"location":{"lat":50.82873218,"lon":4.36569034},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-03-19T12:49:53+01