0ac \u00e0 la s\u00e9ance directement au moniteur (hors entr\u00e9e de piscine)\n> Soit avec un abonnement valable de septembre \u00e0 juin co\u00fbtant 125\u20ac (soit 33 s\u00e9ances pour le prix de 25 s\u00e9ances), qui s\u2019ach\u00e8te uniquement \u00e0 notre accueil en cash jusqu\u2019au 1er octobre 2023 (un abonnement par cours bien d\u00e9fini). \n\n\nSeniors Acad\u00e9mie organise des cours de sports dans diff\u00e9rentes communes de Bruxelles. Consultez le programme complet (yoga, gymnastique douce, aquagym, Qi Gong, Ta\u00efji Quan) dans notre brochure semestrielle l\u2019Echomutualiste Seniors ou sur le site de Solidaris brabant www.solidaris-brabant.be\/fr\/sacademie. \n\nVoici \u00e9galement nos conditions g\u00e9n\u00e9rales","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.solidaris-brabant.be\/fr\/sacademie","email":"sacademie.asbl@solidaris.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 546 14 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003238"},"sp":{"name":"Yoga \u00e0 Ganshoren","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.solidaris-brabant.be\/fr\/sacademie","email":"sacademie.asbl@solidaris.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 546 14 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003238"},"nl":{"name":"Yoga \u00e0 Ganshoren","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.solidaris-brabant.be\/fr\/sacademie","email":"sacademie.asbl@solidaris.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 546 14 94","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50003238"}},"place":{"id":50000671,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Solidaris Brabant Ganshoren","address_street_name":"Rue J. De Greef","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"sacademie.asbl@solidaris.be","website":"www.solidaris-brabant.be\/fr\/sacademie",