Andalusian exuberance, Duo N\u00e9f\u00e9li takes you on an enchanting musical journey through three centuries of music.\n\n","longdescr":"It was chosen from over five hundred submissions from all over the world. Germany, France, Italy, the United States.Het is getiteld \n\nDit programma werd gepresenteerd op het World Harp Congress in Cardiff in juli 2022.\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011364"},"it":{"name":"Opera et moi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011364"},"cn":{"name":"Opera et moi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011364"},"fr":{"name":"Opera et moi.....\u00e9moi","shortdescr":"Notre duo vous propose un tour du monde des plus retentissants airs d\u2019op\u00e9ra, port\u00e9s par la magie et la fougue de deux harpistes de talent. Du bel canto \u00e0 l'improvisation jazz, de la musique intime de cour fran\u00e7aise \u00e0 l'exub\u00e9rance andalouse, le Duo N\u00e9f\u00e9li vous propose un voyage musical en- chantant \u00e0 travers trois si\u00e8cles de musique.Harp \n\n","longdescr":"Le concert estconsacr\u00e9 \u00e0 l'op\u00e9ra avec des oeuvres \u00e9crites sur la Norma, Le Barbier de S\u00e9ville, la Traviata, Carmen et Porgy and Bess entre autres.\nCe programme a \u00e9t\u00e9 pr\u00e9sent\u00e9  au Congr\u00e8s Mondial de la Harpe qui s\u2019est tenu \u00e0 Cardiff en juillet 2022.\nIl a \u00e9t\u00e9 retenu parmi plus de cinq- cents propositions venues du monde entier.Lever de rideau sur le meilleur de l\u2019op\u00e9ra. Allemagne, France, Italie, Etats-Unis. ","performers":"Duo de harpes, duo N\u00e9f\u00e9li. Agn\u00e8s Peytour, Primor Sluchin","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011364"},"sp":{"name":"Opera et moi","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011364"},"nl":{"name":"Opera et moi","shortdescr":" Duo N\u00e9f\u00e9li neemt je mee op een betoverende muzikale reis door drie eeuwen muziek.\nit is entitled \"Op\u00e9ra et moi...\u00e9moi\" and is devoted to opera, with works written on Norma, The Barber of Seville, La Traviata, Carmen and Porgy and Bess among others.\n","longdescr":"een wereldreis langs de meest klinkende opera-aria's, tot leven gebracht door de magie en passie van twee getalenteerde harpisten. Van bel canto tot jazz improvisatie, van intieme Franse hofmuziek tot Andalusische uitbundigheid,Het werd geselecteerd uit meer dan vijfhonderd inzendingen van over de hele wereld. Duitsland, Frankrijk, Itali\u00eb, de Verenigde Staten. \n\"Op\u00e9ra et moi...\u00e9moi\" en is gewijd aan opera, met werken over onder andere Norma, The Barber of Seville, La Traviata, Carmen en Porgy and Bess.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lebaixu.com","email":"contact@lebaixu.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011364"}},"place":{"id":279109,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Baixu","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lebaixu.be","website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 36 18 36","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Picard, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The name \u201cBaixu\u201d means \u201cbeautiful\u201d in the native language of the Patax\u00f3 peoples, indigenous to the south of the state of Bahia in Brazil. This word represents both the ambition of the project and the quality of the cultural events presented, as well as the founders\u2019 attachment to Brazilian culture. Baisu is a quaint and welcoming space in the Tour & Taxis neighborhood in Brussels, which hosts concerts, expositions, screenings, or conferences \u2013 or where you can organise your private event.\r\nA project dedicated to \u201cbeauty\u201d in all its forms, where the keywords are quality, exchange and interaction.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":nul