 Wavre, 141-143","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Talk C.E.C (Cr\u00e9ateur d'Exp\u00e9riences Culturelles), emm\u00e8ne les \u00c9tablissements Demeuldre, ancienne manufacture de porcelaine datant de 1830, vers un nouveau cycle, avec la modernisation des infrastructures et \u00e9quipements ainsi que la restauration et la valorisation de son patrimoine historique, architectural et artistique.\r\nUn lieu novateur multidisciplinaire qui r\u00e9partit ses activit\u00e9s en alliant culture et d\u00e9couverte, conscience \u00e9cologique et divertissement, le tout sur 3 niveaux pour une surface totale de 3.500 m2, au c\u0153ur de la capitale europ\u00e9enne.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"TALK C.E.C","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"141-143","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/talk-gallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 141-143","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"TALK C.E.C","address_street_name":"Waverse Steenweg","address_street_number":"141-143","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/talk-gallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Waverse Steenweg, 141-143","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Talk C.E.C. (Cultural Experiences Creators) brengt de Demeuldre Establishments, een voormalige porseleinfabriek uit 1830, in een nieuwe cyclus, met de modernisering van de infrastructuur en de uitrusting, alsmede de restauratie en opwaardering van het historische, architecturale en artistieke erfgoed.\r\nEen innovatieve, multidisciplinaire locatie die cultuur en ontdekking, ecologisch bewustzijn en vermaak combineert, op drie niveaus met een totale oppervlakte van 3500 m2 in het hart van de Europese hoofdstad.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[4],"translations":{"de":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"pt":[null],"en":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"it":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Matonge\/Saint-Boniface"],"sp":["Matong\u00e9\/Saint-Boniface"],"nl":["Matonge\/Sint-Bonifatius"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":38034,"location":{"lat":50.83555913,"lon":4.36925035},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-05-09T11:19:54+02:00","published_at":"2022-03-22T18:55:46+01:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":278034,"translations":{"de":{"name":"TALK C.E.C","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"141-143","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/talk-gallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 141-143","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"TALK C.E.C","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"141-143","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/talk-gallery.com\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 141-143","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name